  helperWasUsedOnThisArticleState: 0
  articleID: https://TheManWhoCantBeMoved/Stories
  title: Unmovable Man
  bodyText: "A local romantic, Noah has officially set up camp outside the white-columned
    estate he painstakingly renovated, stubbornly declaring he won't be moved until
    his long-lost love sees him on the news and comes running back. \r\n\r\nDespite
    writing 365 daily letters that went entirely unanswered, the heartbroken hopeless
    romantic remains convinced that standing in front of the house like a human lighthouse
    is his best strategy for a reunion. \r\n\r\n\u201CCause if one day you wake up
    and find that you're missing me, and your heart starts to wonder where on this
    Earth I could be, thinking maybe you'll come back here to the place that we'd
    meet. And you'll see me waiting for you on the corner of the street, so I'm not
    moving.\r\n\r\nPeople talk about the guy that's waiting on a girl, there are
    no holes in his shoes but a big hole in his world. Maybe I'll get famous as the
    man who can't be moved, maybe you won't mean to, but you'll see me on the news.
    You'll come running to the corner 'cause you'll know it's just for you, I'm the
    man who can't be moved\u201D\r\n\r\n-Aristotle"
  headliner: <b>Local Man Renovates House in Desperate Bid for Ex to Return</b>
  hasExternalLink: 1
  customComments:
  - I am him, he is me, he is we.
  - Honestly ? same.
  - "She\u2019s engaged to me now noah, let it go\u2026"
